Google Analytics plugin added to LMW. To access it e-mail me privately your 
google account address so that i can add you to the list of those who can 
read analytics. Then just open https://www.google.com/analytics/web/ from 
that account.

selpa'i, tsani and ilmen have admin rights to add you as well.

Google Analytics allows us to monitor all user activity on LMW and e.g. 
find possible problems with activity on certain pages so that we can fix 
them.

It can show bounce rates of certain pages, websites or search queries that 
led newcomers to our website, audience overview by country, browser etc., 
give us real-time reports on user activity etc.

